# Brewfile for the iOS / macOS development environment.
#
# Installed by `mise run ios-dev-init` via `brew bundle install`. Tracks the
# macOS-only tools that the iOS build pipeline (Tauri desktop, Xcode, Rust
# FFI cross-compile, Swift, plugins) calls out to and that mise itself cannot
# provide across both arm64 and x86_64 hosts:
#
# * minisign — x86_64 / arm64-universal binary. The Rust crate on crates.io
#   is library-only, and the GitHub release tarballs ship arm64-only Mach-O
#   binaries that fail with "Bad CPU type in executable" on x86_64 macOS
#   (e.g. the MacBookPro15,2 used as the CI Intel runner). Homebrew's bottles
#   are universal. Required at build time by
#   crates/livtet-lua-plugins/build.rs (signature verification) and at
#   rotation time by .mise/tasks/plugin-key-rotate.

brew "minisign"
